refusals = "Retain the five transcript comparisons for invalid commit signature, wrong program, altered membership proof, mismatched read block hash and insufficient read verification. The live hosted test services/platform/hosted/indexer/tests/repair_22_31_350.rs::ai_market_rejects_altered_membership_and_unsigned_reads_across_restart drives fresh guest captures through ProjectionStore::observe and promote: an appended membership-proof byte returns FinalityUnavailable and Unverified reads with intact membership return BindingMismatch, remaining rank zero without a binding, publication event or finalized view across reopen; the otherwise identical SequencerSigned control promotes and recovers its binding."
