boundary = "The programs focused gate retains production guest, codec and consensus verification code with a recorded hosted peer. Live production consumer refusal and restart coverage belongs to services/platform/hosted/indexer/tests/repair_22_31_350.rs::ai_market_rejects_altered_membership_and_unsigned_reads_across_restart; programs intentionally does not depend on the hosted indexer, and neither test proves signed ProgramRead receipts."

